   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear all, <div>I am using lavaan all the time, and I really love it. However, this time, I cannot seem to be able to find a way to run an Exploratory SEM. Is there a workaround to do ESEM with lavaan? If not, are you aware of any other R package that can do it?</div><div><br><div>Thank you for your responses (hope you enjoyed your summer holidays)</div></div><div><br></div><div>Iasonas</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
